{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ae32f586e64acd28","name":"Security Personnel Specialist","source":{"id":"source:reference-ae32f586e64acd28","title":"Security Personnel Specialist","revision":19022,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:09:21Z","sha256":"544c8d402c3efbc30f55d622be1894dbb7b4b7dbe6e763765fee1403d096cb46","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19022","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Security%20Personnel%20Specialist&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ae32f586e64acd28","blocks":[{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Security Specialist in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Security Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Security_Specialist","referenceId":"reference:389610478bbd6fba"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Security Personnel Specialist is an elite guard who has the benefit of special training and extensive experience. Similar in many ways to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bodyguards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bodyguards"},", Security Specialists are typically the last line of defense between their employer and his or her enemies. Security Specialists are commonly trained in close-combat fighting and are equipped to deal with just about any sort of foe. Security Specialists vary a great deal, as necessary for their particular mission, so you should customize this statistics block to meet your needs.   \n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Security Personnel Specialist Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Security Personnel Specialists are more advanced versions of standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Security Personnel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Security_Personnel","referenceId":"reference:d80efac571afb3e2"},". These are special operatives selected for their unswerving loyalty and discipline. Governments and employers relied on them to crack down on unruly civilians or to provide the best protection available. Security Specialists are less numerous than standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Security Personnel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Security_Personnel","referenceId":"reference:d80efac571afb3e2"}," and might be charged with leading a security team. Typically, Security Specialists answer directly to their employers, but in the case of some wealthy and powerful charges, they might deal with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bodyguard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bodyguard","referenceId":"reference:998e41b432f4d199"}," who oversees the entire security detail. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In some instances, a security team might include a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},". Patrol Droids might fill in for security forces or accompany them as they make their rounds, likewise, Security Droids can also augment a security force's strength, though Battle Droids and Military Droids are rare after ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". On the other hand, within ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},", Droids served almost exclusively as security forces.  \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Security Personnel Specialist Statistics (CL 5)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 21 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 19), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 21, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 16; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Riot Shield"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Riot_Shield","referenceId":"reference:004c9273dbaf0a1a"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 67, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 21\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," 4 Squares\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Melee:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," +7 (1d4+5)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Melee:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Baton"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Baton","referenceId":"refe